    <h2>Suspension and termination</h2>
    <p>You can stop using the service and delete your account at any time. We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms, put the service or others at risk, or are abandoned, and where practical we will tell you why. After termination your data is deleted as described in the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

